('advai_advice', 'Honestly, do the quests in your zone first. The XP is better than grinding.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Don''t skip quest rewards, half my gear came from them.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Pick up every quest in town before you head out, it saves a lot of walking.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Find a group for the elites. Soloing them is a waste of repair money.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'I''d stick with one zone until the quests run dry.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Rest at an inn between fights if you can. Rested XP adds up.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Keep your professions leveling alongside, it pays off later.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Try the dungeons if you can find a group, the gear is worth it.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Don''t forget to train new abilities every couple of levels.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Sell the grey junk as you go so your bags don''t clog up.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Learn the flight paths early, it saves so much running.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'I''d read the quest text. Sometimes it tells you exactly where to go.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Grind a few mobs near the quest area, you''ll finish objectives faster.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Check the vendors for bag upgrades. More room helps a lot.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Do the group quests with someone, they go much quicker.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Don''t pull more than you can handle. Two at a time is plenty for me.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Eat and drink between pulls, it''s cheap and keeps you going.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'If a quest is red for you, come back a couple levels later.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Pay attention to your gear. An upgrade now and then makes everything easier.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'I''d save the money for your mount at level 40.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Take the long way round if there''s a safer path, dying costs time.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Ask in the city channel, someone is usually looking for a group.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Stick to the roads when you''re low on health.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Kill what''s near the quest first, then loot as you go.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Try fishing or cooking, the food buffs are good.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Don''t stand in the fire. I learned that the hard way.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Skin or mine what you pass if your professions allow it.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Use your cooldowns on the tough ones, not the trash.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Check what your class trainer has, you might be missing a spell.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
('advai_advice', 'Turn in quests as you finish them so you don''t forget.', 0, 0, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
